SUMMARY:Summer Camp
DESCRIPTION:Grant funded summer camp is being offered July 6 through August 6th. Enjoy drama\, music\, sports\, exercise and conditioning\, games and art activities. The camp is focused on building self-esteem\, effective communication skills\, decision making\, healthy choices\, and avoiding negative risks. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
