SUMMARY:Youth Action Group
DESCRIPTION:Montclair youth are invited to join an evening youth group focused on building a leadership program. A safe space for youth to come together and talk\, listen and learn about issues they are facing. Building leadership skills is key to our group. These new leaders will focus on working with younger children and creating a more positive environment within the community!! Everyone is welcome! Join us if you are outgoing join us if you are shy! Talk a lot listen a lot .. you will learn a lot! Begins Wednesday July 22. Middle School 7-8pm\, High School 8-9pm\, meeting every other week during the summer months. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
