SUMMARY:Plant Bingo at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a summer evening of friendly competition\, plant prizes\, and plenty of chances to meet new plant-loving pals. \nDoors open at 6:00PM. Chairs will be set up on the formal lawn behind Van Vleck House and a cash bar will be on the terrace*. The event will take place inside if it rains. Winners will be able to select a portable plant to take home as their prize. \nTickets are $5 and include a bingo card. No pets\, outside alcohol or food permitted. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
