SUMMARY:Women's Circle
DESCRIPTION:Women’s Circle is a monthly gathering for women to come together in a supportive\, intentional space. Each month centers on a new theme\, offering time for reflection\, connection\, and shared growth. New participants are always welcome. \nWe suggest bringing a journal and a small object that reflects the month’s theme. This might be a photo\, token\, or meaningful item that helps ground your experience. \nNot sure what to expect? We’ll circle up with other identifying women for guided conversation\, reflection\, and ritual. With Connie’s facilitation\, the evening is designed to help you reconnect with yourself and with one another. Expect to leave feeling refreshed\, grounded\, and supported as you move through the season ahead. \nFinancial Assistance is available. Reach out if you have any questions: info@yogamechanics.com \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
