SUMMARY:Beyond The Brush: Brews & Brushes w/ Lovlee Tang at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Grab your friends and join us for an unforgettable evening of creativity\, community\, and craft beer at Beyond the Brush: Brews & Brushes! \nHosted by Lovlee Art Studios in partnership with Montclair Brewery\, this guided paint experience is perfect for beginners and experienced artists alike. \nYour $50 ticket includes: \n* A 16″ x 20″ canvas\n* All painting materials\n* Step-by-step instruction\n* One complimentary beer from Montclair Brewery \nBYOF – Bring Your Own Food! Pack your favorite snacks or meal and make it a fun night out. \nCome for an evening filled with laughter\, great beer\, creative fun\, and a welcoming atmosphere where you can relax\, connect\, and leave with your own masterpiece. \nWe can’t wait to paint\, sip\, and create with you! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
