SUMMARY:Going Global: A Free Two-Part Workshop Series
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your business beyond U.S. borders? Join us for an insightful two-part workshop series designed to transform your growth from local to worldwide. On August 4\, we’ll explore whether exporting is the right move for your business\, assess your readiness\, and identify which of your products or services have international demand. By August 18\, you’ll be ready for part two\, where we’ll dive into the real logistics—finding international buyers\, navigating permits and paperwork\, and mapping out your clear path forward. Expert facilitator Reina Valenzuela will guide you through the opportunities\, close your knowledge gaps\, and leave you with a concrete action plan. Whether you’re curious about global expansion or ready to take the leap\, this free series gives you the framework and clarity to do it right. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
